# Vulnerabilities intentionally excluded from the Trivy HIGH/CRITICAL gate.
# Keep this list small and review it regularly. Every entry below has NO
# fix available in the Debian 13 (trixie) repository as of 2026-09-20, so
# no python:3.12-slim (Debian 13) image can pass the gate without these
# exemptions. Remove each entry as soon as the base image ships the patch,
# then re-verify the Trivy gate.

# util-linux 2.41.5-0+deb13u1 (latest in trixie): mount helper / nsenter /
# bind-mount issues. Affects util-linux, bsdutils, mount, login and the
# libblkid1/liblastlog2-2/libmount1/libsmartcols1/libuuid1 libraries.
CVE-2026-76642
CVE-2026-78408
CVE-2026-78409
CVE-2026-78410

# ncurses 6.5+20250216-2 (latest in trixie): buffer overflow in libncursesw6,
# libtinfo6, ncurses-base, ncurses-bin.
CVE-2025-69720

# systemd 257.13-1~deb13u1 (latest in trixie): systemd-homed LPE via missing
# home-record signature verification. Affects libsystemd0, libudev1.
CVE-2026-16742

# acl 2.3.2-2+b1 (latest in trixie): symlink traversal privilege escalation
# in libacl functions (libacl1).
CVE-2026-54369

# perl-base: CVE-2026-9538 (perl-Archive-Tar DoS via crafted tar header).
# Debian security marks this fix_deferred, so no patched perl-base exists in
# current Debian 13 images.
CVE-2026-9538
